            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A user apparatus in a communication system comprising: a plurality of user apparatuses configured to communicate with each other in a sidelink; and a base station configured to wirelessly communicate with each of the user apparatuses, wherein the user apparatus performs a setting related to resources for unicast communication in the sidelink.</p>
